# Diagnosis only (airport/1 dev start, Null backend, dev cheats, tp and the dev-only hold token `aimhead`): kill the airport GateKeeper with the water jet only.
# Squat (L) + stick BACK raises the nozzle (stick forward lowers it); the sweep over distance and stick strength hits the raised head.
waitfor stage=0 scen=1 director mario dirstate=4 timeout=3000
cheat infinite_health
cheat infinite_water
wait frames=30
log
tp x=-997 y=320 z=1034 yaw=-47
wait frames=6
hold L trig=255,255 stick=0,-50 aimhead frames=60
log
